  (text "USB-C: one 5.1k Rd per CC pin. Both USB2 D+/D- pairs are joined.\nVBUS connects only to Q6 gate sensing through 100k, with a 1M bleed.\nAll FTDI supplies derive from target power; no VBUS-to-supply path.\nSBU pins NC; shell bonded to GND. No PD or SuperSpeed circuitry."
    (at 398.78 345.44 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "9fe4445b-63ce-517e-9309-df4111693b03"))
